## Questions and answers

**How far can the {{ short }} go on a charge?**
Up to {{ m.range_km }} km (WLTP) with the {{ m.battery_kwh }} kWh battery. Cold weather, high speeds and a full load shorten that.

**How fast does it charge?**
From 10 to 80 % in about {{ c1080(m) }} minutes at a fast charger that delivers {{ m.peak_charge_kw }} kW or more. On AC it charges at up to {{ onboard_kw(m) }} kW, empty to full in about {{ ac_hours(m) }} hours.

**Can it tow?**
{% if m.towing_kg %}
Yes, up to {{ m.towing_kg | n }} kg braked.{% if "Tow" in m.option_packs %} The Tow pack adds an electrically deployable tow bar and trailer stability control.{% endif %}

{% else %}
No. The {{ m.name }} is not rated for towing.
{% endif %}

**Does it have a heat pump?**
{% if m.heat_pump_standard %}
Yes, on every trim.
{% else %}
On {{ short }} Plus and Prime, through the Winter pack. On {{ short }} Pure the Winter pack is an option.
{% endif %}

**Which driver assistance does it have?**
Voltrieve Pilot version {{ m.pilot_version }}: {{ pilot_features(m.pilot_version) | and_join }}.

